{"quest_id":"quest.local.lf83","things_ord":0,"state":"after-40","value":"a band of fresh grey clay rammed in behind the coping and down the lining on the ford side (place_local_state_variants lf83-well-clayed)"}
{"quest_id":"quest.local.lf83","things_ord":0,"state":"before-40","value":"a new crack a finger wide from the coping down the lining on the ford side, with old mortar lines of earlier mending beside it; examining it sets flag.lf83.crack-seen (an activator: handed to the planner, 16b)"}
