{"quest_id":"quest.local.lf83","things_ord":2,"state":"all","value":"the page for 3 to 6 Rain's Hand: buckets drawn, beds let, the poler's wife charged nothing for wash water, a new crack in the well head a finger wide, travellers asking why the landing charges them again; reading it where it lies sets flag.lf83.ledger-read (a document-read hook: handed to the planner, 16b)"}
