{"quest_id":"quest.local.lf83","things_ord":8,"state":"all","value":"a clay dipper of the well's water, owned by Livia Varinius; she gives it to a traveller who has paid the stop (her two-charges line, giveItem); taken unasked it is theft if seen"}
